      "value": "@{5f6be62b15f9fa5364f1834c|full_name} Is your Udon script frequently setting the time index? If so, that's probably the cause of the hitching; it interacts poorly with the efforts to resync the audio and visual.\nI've been considering leaving the resync off by default, which might be wise.\nFor (2 and 3): you can turn it on and off through udon. There should be a new SDK.",
